  "comments": "Monarchy:<br />\r\nKing Gyanendra Bir Bikram was the last king of Shah Dynasty (Reign: 4 June 2001 – 28 May 2008)<br />\r\nRepublic:<br />\r\nSubsequently Nepal became a Federal Democratic Republic (i.e.28/05/2008)<br />\r\nWith Dr. Ram Baran Yadav, as the first President of Nepal<br /><br />\r\nSmall differences between the two years:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/571cf07eedaf6.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/571cf07eedaf6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" /></a><br /><br />\r\nOne more difference between the two years is the lettering in NEPAL , wider with narrower spacing in monarchy, mor obvious in E<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d08bd407f3b1.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d08bd407f3b1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"119\" /></a>",
